# Documentation & Human-Facing Content Sync

Apply this file whenever you change **user-visible** behavior, **terminology**, **version**, **demo UX**, or **release/CI** behavior. It complements **Rule SF-3** (version consistency across SKILL, pyproject, tests, etc.): SF-3 covers canonical version strings; these rules cover **all related human-facing surfaces**.

